- **Identical result shapes:** `client.ts` `import type`s `RunResult`/`RunWithTestsResult`/`TestResult`/`PyodideTestSpec` straight from `src/lib/pyodide/client.ts` and re-exports them, so the two runtimes can't structurally drift. PNG from `display_data` decoded to `Uint8Array` on `result.png`; `traceback`/`errorType`/`errorMessage` carried through.
